concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Subsection 126(3A) of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Part, applies to disclosures of AUSTRAC information that occur on or after the commencement of this item, whether the AUSTRAC information was obtained before, on or after that commencement.  Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 1 Computer-assisted decision making  Part 3 No. 63, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023" ;
    skos:definition "Subsection 126(3A) of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Part, applies to disclosures of AUSTRAC information that occur on or after the commencement of this item, whether the AUSTRAC information was obtained before, on or after that commencement.  Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 1 Computer-assisted decision making  Part 3 No. 63, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f2635b5d49cbbf9b15fd0637655e7070d6ce3e8fa0067aeb3bab7da6f618a3ce" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
