concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-5-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Subsection 22(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) The testimony must purport to be signed or certified by: (a) a judge, magistrate or officer in or of the foreign country concerned; or (b) a person who is authorised, by or under a law of the foreign country concerned, to: (i) administer an oath or affirmation; or (ii) impose an obligation on the person giving the testimony to tell the truth." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) The testimony must purport to be signed or certified by: (a) a judge, magistrate or officer in or of the foreign country concerned; or (b) a person who is authorised, by or under a law of the foreign country concerned, to: (i) administer an oath or affirmation; or (ii) impose an obligation on the person giving the testimony to tell the truth."@en ;
