concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17A(3) Suspension of protection and assistance on request by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-17a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A suspension under subsection (1) ceases to have effect: (a) when the participant requests in writing that the suspension cease; or (b) if the request under subsection (1) specifies a time for the suspension to cease—at that time.  Witness protection  Schedule 9 Suspension of protection and assistance  Part 2 No. 63, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023 Notice of decision" ;
