concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17A(4) Suspension of protection and assistance on request by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-17a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If a participant makes a request under subsection (1), the Commissioner must, as soon as practicable after the request is made: (a) give written notice to the participant of the Commissioner’s decision to suspend, or not to suspend, protection and assistance; and (b) notify the relevant approved authority of that decision. Effect of suspension" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If a participant makes a request under subsection (1), the Commissioner must, as soon as practicable after the request is made: (a) give written notice to the participant of the Commissioner’s decision to suspend, or not to suspend, protection and assistance; and (b) notify the relevant approved authority of that decision. Effect of suspension"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4b42219835cb991896ef3b08d4f03fd76e9732a4155788f2f3596be31f9663a3" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17a ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner must notify participant and approved authority of decision to suspend protection and assistance." ;
    dc:description "written notice, notification" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
