concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17C Review of decision to suspend protection and assistance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-17c ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to a decision under subsection 17B(1) to suspend the protection and assistance provided to a participant under the NWPP (a suspension decision), other than such a decision made as a result of a review under this section. (2) A participant who receives notification of a suspension decision may, within 7 days after receiving the notification, apply in writing to the Commissioner for a review of the decision. (3) If an application is made, the Commissioner: (a) must review the decision, and confirm, reverse or vary it; and (b) before making that decision, must give the participant a reasonable opportunity to state the participant’s case; and (c) after making that decision, must inform the participant in writing of the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies to a decision under subsection 17B(1) to suspend the protection and assistance provided to a participant under the NWPP (a suspension decision), other than such a decision made as a result of a review under this section. (2) A participant who receives notification of a suspension decision may, within 7 days after receiving the notification, apply in writing to the Commissioner for a review of the decision. (3) If an application is made, the Commissioner: (a) must review the decision, and confirm, reverse or vary it; and (b) before making that decision, must give the participant a reasonable opportunity to state the participant’s case; and (c) after making that decision, must inform the participant in writing of the decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1010c62b8906d4b853322c90bd61d0932f09999ef06f1e42fa696879b0b5a7dc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17c-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17c-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17c-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
