doc:sch-9-sec-17c-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17C(3) Review of decision to suspend protection and assistance" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If an application is made, the Commissioner: (a) must review the decision, and confirm, reverse or vary it; and (b) before making that decision, must give the participant a reasonable opportunity to state the participant’s case; and (c) after making that decision, must inform the participant in writing of the decision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer .

