    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-10-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the item, substitute: Independent Commission Against Corruption of South Australia the Commissioner of the Commission (a) the Commissioner; or (b) the Deputy Commissioner; or (c) a member of the staff of the Commission; or (d) an examiner or investigator (within the meaning of the Independent (a) the Commissioner; or (b) the Deputy Commissioner; or (c) an executive level member of the staff of the Commission the chief officer authorises under subsection (5)  Schedule 10  Amendments relating to the South Australian Independent Commission Against Corruption  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023 No. 63, 2023 Commission Against Corruption Act 2012 (SA)) of the Commission Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979" ;
