doc:sch-10-sec-17 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17 Subsection 5(1) (paragraph (i) of the definition of" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "permitted purpose) Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (i) in the case of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA):  Schedule 10  Amendments relating to the South Australian Independent Commission Against Corruption  Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023 No. 63, 2023 (i) an investigation under the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA) into corruption in public administration (within the meaning of that Act); or (ii) a report on such an investigation; or" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer .

