concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-10-sec-30 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30 Paragraph 157(2)(p) of Schedule 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-10-sec-30 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (p) each of the following is an eligible purpose of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA): (i) an investigation under the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA) into corruption in public administration (within the meaning of that Act); (ii) a report on such an investigation. [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 29 March 2023 Senate on 13 June 2023] (36/23)" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (p) each of the following is an eligible purpose of the Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA): (i) an investigation under the Independent Commission Against Corruption Act (SA) into corruption in public administration (within the meaning of that Act); (ii) a report on such an investigation. [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 29 March 2023 Senate on 13 June 2023] (36/23)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "88037babc446a980e59af3c096a8140422a6b9c10768400a6c80eeef03ac0e65" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeal paragraph, substitute with new purpose for Independent Commission Against Corruption (SA)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
